@host = http://localhost:5000

### REAL TIKTOK: check official integration configuration
GET {{host}}/api/tiktok/config

### REAL TIKTOK: open this URL in a browser to start Login Kit OAuth
### The configured redirect URI must point to /api/tiktok/oauth/callback and be registered in TikTok Developer Portal.
GET {{host}}/api/tiktok/oauth/start

### REAL TIKTOK: after OAuth, inspect connected accounts (tokens are never returned)
GET {{host}}/api/tiktok/connections

### REAL TIKTOK: replace OPEN_ID with the openId returned by the OAuth callback
GET {{host}}/api/tiktok/accounts/OPEN_ID/profile

### REAL TIKTOK: recent public videos + actual view/like/comment/share metrics
GET {{host}}/api/tiktok/accounts/OPEN_ID/videos?maxCount=20

### REAL TIKTOK: audience-vs-reach pain audit
GET {{host}}/api/tiktok/accounts/OPEN_ID/audit?maxCount=20

### Social-provider capabilities
GET {{host}}/api/providers

### Account-factory provider capabilities
GET {{host}}/api/account-factory/providers

### Normalize a TikTok profile target (read-only integration boundary)
POST {{host}}/api/providers/tiktok/normalize-target
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target": "https://www.tiktok.com/@longgmilk"
}

### Create an account-factory simulation campaign
POST {{host}}/api/account-factory/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "simulator-registration",
  "emailProvider": "simulator-mail",
  "region": "VN",
  "quantity": 1000
}

### TikTok account-creation boundary: accepted as architecture, creation is blocked
POST {{host}}/api/account-factory/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "tiktok-registration",
  "emailProvider": "simulator-mail",
  "region": "VN",
  "quantity": 1000
}

### Replace CREATION_CAMPAIGN_ID after creating a factory campaign
GET {{host}}/api/account-factory/campaigns/CREATION_CAMPAIGN_ID

### Account-factory/inventory stats
GET {{host}}/api/account-factory/stats

### Recent account-creation jobs
GET {{host}}/api/account-factory/jobs/recent?take=50

### Recent synthetic identities
GET {{host}}/api/account-factory/identities/recent?take=20

### Replenish inventory when active pool falls below threshold
POST {{host}}/api/account-factory/replenish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minimumActive": 10000,
  "batchSize": 2000,
  "provider": "simulator-registration",
  "emailProvider": "simulator-mail",
  "region": "VN"
}

### Direct synthetic seed for load tests (bypasses registration pipeline)
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 10000
}

### Inspect pool
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/stats

### Create a simulated direct-follow campaign from account inventory
POST {{host}}/api/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "simulator",
  "target": "demo_target",
  "quantity": 1000,
  "startingFollowers": 100
}

### TikTok social provider campaign: target is accepted/normalized, mutation is deliberately blocked
POST {{host}}/api/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "tiktok",
  "target": "https://www.tiktok.com/@longgmilk",
  "quantity": 1000,
  "startingFollowers": 0
}

### Replace CAMPAIGN_ID after creating a follow campaign
GET {{host}}/api/campaigns/CAMPAIGN_ID

### Refill missing simulated delivery with unused eligible accounts
POST {{host}}/api/campaigns/CAMPAIGN_ID/refill

### Read simulated target count
GET {{host}}/api/targets/simulator/demo_target

### Read normalized TikTok target state
GET {{host}}/api/targets/tiktok/longgmilk

### Recent follow jobs
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/recent?take=50
